@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam ArrowColor #395E76
skinparam classBorderColor #16384D
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F3F7FA
skinparam componentBorderColor #16384D
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F3F7FA
skinparam packageBorderColor #9AAEBC
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam actorBorderColor #16384D
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F3F7FA
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #16384D
skinparam dpi 130
title Cambios de estado durante la venta
scale 10 as 70 pixels
robust "Asiento" as A
robust "Pago simulado" as P
robust "Boleto" as B
@0
A is LIBRE
P is PENDIENTE
B is NO_EMITIDO
@3
A is RESERVADO
@55
P is APROBADO
@70
A is VENDIDO
B is EMITIDO
@300
A is VENDIDO
footer Ejemplo ilustrativo. Venta objetivo menor de 90 s. Sin confirmacion, la reserva vence a los 300 s.
@enduml
